			"notes": "__**Robin's Apoli Additions**__\n\nThis addon is an abstraction of one of my deprecated mods CCPacks, where I have extracted all Apoli-specific parts, and created this addon.\n\nA short overview of the features added:\n- Universal Powers; Powers that can be granted globally to all specified mobs and entities.\n- Choices; Functionally Similar to Origins GUI, with some additional features that I prefer.\n- Some Power types that I have used in a few different origins I've worked on.\n- An expansion on the `execute if`  and `execute store` commands to include `resource`\n- And More!"
